<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Treasury announces next state note issue.</title>
<headline>Belgian Treasury announces next state note issue.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said in a statement on Friday it was inviting subscriptions for the next issue of five-year notes, extendable to seven years, and 3/5/7 year revisable rate state notes.</p>
<p>Subscriptions run from March 11 to 17.  </p>
<p>The 3/5/7 note has put options at three, five and seven years. The issue will be priced at a later date. Payment day is March 18.</p>
<p>This is the fourth issue of such state notes.</p>
<p>The last issue of the notes, in December, raised eight billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
